  "rationale": "Both answers are valid for the stated sense, but the national distinction is materially overstated. Malaysian authoritative dictionary sources define \"fotokopi\" as a photographic copy and identify \"fotostat\" as equivalent to \"fotokopi\"; \"salinan fotostat\" is also an accepted Malaysian expression. Thus the relation should not be presented as a clean different-common-word contrast. No false-friend contrast is needed.",
  "claim_reviews": [
    {
      "subject": "English cue and sense",
      "conclusion": "Correct and aligned: photocopy is a reproduction of printed or written material made photographically.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://kbbi.kemendikdasmen.go.id/entri/fotokopi",
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=175768&keyword=fotokopi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Indonesian answer: fotokopi",
      "conclusion": "Correct and ordinary in Indonesian; KBBI defines fotokopi as photographic reproduction of printed writing.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://kbbi.kemendikdasmen.go.id/entri/fotokopi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Malaysian answer: salinan fotostat",
      "conclusion": "Correct and accepted, but not uniquely Malaysian. Malaysian DBP sources define fotokopi directly and state that fotostat has the same meaning; official Malaysian usage also attests salinan fotostat.",
      "material_risk": true,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=175768&keyword=fotokopi",
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=175768&keyword=fotostat",
        "https://lampiran1.hasil.gov.my/pdf/pdfam/FAQC_cp204.pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "National split and final relation",
      "conclusion": "Materially overstated. Malaysian ordinary and dictionary-accepted usage overlaps with Indonesian fotokopi, so different-common-word is not defensible as a clean relation. A shared-synonym or different-preference relation would be more accurate.",
      "material_risk": true,
      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=175768&keyword=fotokopi",
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=175768&keyword=fotostat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "False-friend contrast",
      "conclusion": "No false-friend contrast is warranted: the forms refer to the same document-reproduction sense, and the card provides no misleading cross-variety meaning contrast.",
      "material_risk": false,
      "evidence_limitation": "This is a semantic assessment of the candidate pair; no separate false-friend source is necessary."
